==Reception==
===Viewership===
''[[Deadline Hollywood]]'' reported that each episode of ''Peacemaker'' received higher viewership than the last,<ref name="DeadlineRatingsSuccess" /> and HBO Max stated that the season finale's viewership was 44 percent higher than the series premiere's. According to the service, the finale broke the record for highest single day viewership of an HBO Max original episode.<ref name="GunnFinaleViewership" /> In the UK, where ''Peacemaker'' was not released until after it had finished airing in the US,<ref name="UKRelease" /> the series was the third-most [[Copyright infringement|pirated]] for the first quarter of 2022 after [[HBO]]'s ''[[Euphoria (American TV series)|Euphoria]]'' and [[Disney+]]'s ''[[The Book of Boba Fett]]''.<ref name="TorrentFreak" />

According to [[Samba TV]], 22% more U.S. households watched the premiere of the second season than the finale of the first season.<ref>{{Cite web|last=McGloin|first=Matt|date=August 26, 2025|title=Peacemaker Season 2 Opens Strong With 22% Boost in Viewership|url=https://cosmicbook.news/peacemaker-season-2-ratings-boost|website=Cosmic Book News}}</ref>

